    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebound Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebound Rush is a fast paced sport game where you duel your friends in a life size pinball arena. Conquer the crowd and terrain by avoiding and using obstacles to your advantage and score in your oponnent's nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful though, the commentator might hinder you by moving the net or throwing items\u00a0to make the match more spicy! Watch\u00a0out for boomboxes and use them\u00a0to keep your opponent on the edge!<br><br><i><strong>Heads up!</strong> Rebound Rush is a two-player-only experience\u2014whether you're battling it out in couch PvP or via Steam Remote Play, you'll need a friend to duel (after all, what's life without a few broken friendships over video games?). No buddy nearby? Go outside and make one\u2014we believe in you. Good luck!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rebound Rush</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebound Rush is a fast paced sport game where you duel your friends in a life size pinball arena. Conquer the crowd and terrain by avoiding and using obstacles to your advantage and score in your oponnent's nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful though, the commentator might hinder you by moving the net or throwing items\u00a0to make the match more spicy! Watch\u00a0out for boomboxes and use them\u00a0to keep your opponent on the edge!<br><br><i><strong>Heads up!</strong> Rebound Rush is a two-player-only experience\u2014whether you're battling it out in couch PvP or via Steam Remote Play, you'll need a friend to duel (after all, what's life without a few broken friendships over video games?). No buddy nearby? Go outside and make one\u2014we believe in you. Good luck!</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Duel your friends in a life-sized pinball arena in a high-tension one-on-one sport! Parry a constantly accelerating ball and launch it into your opponent\u2019s goal to win the match. But watch out \u2014 the commentator might have a trick or two to spice things up... Good luck!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
